aily. The treatment duration should not exceed 2 weeks. Occluded lesions: Occlusion with a polyethylene film overnight may be utilized to enhance therapeutic efficacy.", "missedDose": "Apply the missed dose as soon as remembered. If it is almost time for the next scheduled dose, skip the missed dose and resume the regular dosing schedule. Do not double the dose to make up for a forgotten application.", "administration": "Topical formulation presented as a cream for external cutaneous use.", "overdoseManagement": "Cushing's syndrome and adrenal cortical insufficiency may develop following excessive or prolonged topical application of corticosteroids exceeding 3 weeks."}, "detailedIngredients": {"activeIngredients": "Betamethasone valerate, Fusidic acid (6.07 mg, 100 mg)"}}	t	ACTIVE	2026-04-08 21:38:03.79	fendexi-forte-0-607percent-10percent-topical-cream-for-dermatitis-and-pruritus-10g-tube	\N
