ulose, lactose monohydrate, hypromellose, magnesium stearate, povidone, propyl gallate, colloidal anhydrous silica, red iron oxide, yellow iron oxide, titanium dioxide, talc, propylene glycol qs ad 1 tablet.", "activeIngredients": "Felodipine 5mg"}, "specialPatientGroups": {"geriatric": "Initial dose 2.5 mg/day; elderly patients may exhibit heightened sensitivity to the hypotensive effects, requiring careful dose titration and monitoring.", "pediatric": "Initial dose 2.5 mg/day, maximum 10 mg/day under pediatric cardiology supervision.", "pregnancy": "Contraindicated throughout pregnancy due to potential risks to maternal and fetal hemodynamics."}, "warningsAndPrecautions": ["Patients with diminished cardiac reserve or severe heart failure.", "Patients presenting with cardiogenic shock, recent myocardial infarction within the past 2 to 4 weeks, or acute unstable angina pectoris.", "Felodipine is not indicated for the acute management of chronic stable angina pectoris as initial monotherapy in unstable settings.", "Abrupt withdrawal of Felodipine therapy may precipitate rebound ischemia or worsening of angina pectoris.", "Patients with a documented history of myocardial ischemia secondary to calcium channel blocker therapy."]}	t	ACTIVE	2026-04-08 21:25:28.915	felodipine-5mg-extended-release-tablets-stella-for-hypertension-and-angina-pectoris-box-of-10	39
