es mellitus, hypertension, heart failure, and growing children.", "Due to the risk of adverse effects, systemic corticosteroids should be used with caution in elderly patients, at the lowest possible dose and for the shortest possible duration.", "Acute adrenal insufficiency may occur upon abrupt discontinuation after prolonged treatment or during stress. When high doses are used, the effect of vaccination may be affected.", "Effects on occupation: Caution is advised when using this medication as it may cause adverse effects that could affect individuals working at heights and other demanding occupations."], "adverseReactionManagement": "Upon experiencing adverse reactions to the medication, discontinue use and inform a physician or seek immediate medical attention at the nearest healthcare facility."}	t	ACTIVE	2026-04-08 21:35:39.412	methylprednisolone-4-mg-oral-tablets-10-blisters-x-10-tablets	\N
