redients": "Candesartan Cilexetil 8.0mg"}, "specialPatientGroups": {"lactation": "The medication should not be used during breastfeeding due to potential severe adverse reactions in nursing infants.", "pregnancy": "Discontinue the medication as soon as pregnancy is detected, especially during the second and third trimesters."}, "warningsAndPrecautions": ["Hypotension in salt- and volume-depleted patients: Symptomatic hypotension should be corrected prior to initiation of therapy or treatment should be conducted under close medical supervision.", "Renal impairment: Monitor renal function closely during administration of the medication.", "Pregnancy: Discontinue the medication as soon as pregnancy is detected, especially during the second and third trimesters.", "Lactation: The medication should not be used during breastfeeding due to potential severe adverse reactions in nursing infants."]}	t	ACTIVE	2026-04-08 21:50:23.11	atasart-8mg-tablets-for-hypertension-and-heart-failure-2-blisters-x-7-tablets	378
